DESCRIPTION:I Love to Write Day falls on November 15 and asks people of any
  age to spend part of the day writing something: a poem\, a letter\, the f
 irst page of a novel. It was created in 2002 by John Riddle\, an author in
  Bear\, Delaware\, and it is unusually well attested for a grassroots obse
 rvance: the founder is still at it\, still explaining it on the record\, a
 nd candid that he picked the date for no reason at all.\n\nhttps://todayce
 lebrates.com/holiday/i-love-to-write-day/
